{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemecategoricaltagcomponenttokensprovider\/colorbgcategory1"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Has for value token MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: OrangeBrandColorRawTokens.colorDecorativeEmerald500, dark: OrangeBrandColorRawTokens.colorDecorativeEmerald400) (= light: “#50BE87FF” \/ dark: “#75CCA1FF”)","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"OUDSThemesOrange","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"title":"colorBgCategory1","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B42ThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProviderC16colorBgCategory118OUDSTokensSemantic013MultipleColorM5TokenCvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorBgCategory1","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider\/colorBgCategory1"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"colorBgCategory1"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemecategoricaltagcomponenttokensprovider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"component  tokens of categorical tag","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"tag","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCategoricalTag"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CategoricalTagComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"categorical tags","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Categorical tags","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of colors ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"title":"OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider"},"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/MultipleColorSemanticToken":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A semantic token that wraps a combination of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/ColorSemanticToken","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values based on the color scheme (light or dark mode)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Figma","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" inside one object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a color token has a value that depends on the color scheme, it must be packed in a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplecolorsemantictoken","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider/colorBgCategory1":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemecategoricaltagcomponenttokensprovider\/colorbgcategory1","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: OrangeBrandColorRawTokens.colorDecorativeEmerald500, dark: OrangeBrandColorRawTokens.colorDecorativeEmerald400) (= light: “#50BE87FF” \/ dark: “#75CCA1FF”)"}],"title":"colorBgCategory1","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorBgCategory1","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeCategoricalTagComponentTokensProvider\/colorBgCategory1"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}],"type":"image","alt":null,"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Theme Orange","kind":"text"}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"title":"Theme Orange","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange"}}}